{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n好多香港人朝早為咗貪快方便，都會買個麵包當早餐。但原來單單一個菠蘿包已經有 333 卡路里！以為揀「無餡」會比較健康？但其實有啲無餡麵包脂肪含量比有餡仲高，隨時食一件已經等於吞咗兩匙油落肚！\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/istock-2220384007_3927877426ae41f9d35e6b-1024x577.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"日本認證殺脂神物 （圖片來源：iStock）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"312\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/istock-2220384007_3927877426ae41f9d35e6b-1024x577.jpg\" width=\"554\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：iStock）</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><b>拆解麵包 4 大致肥陷阱拆解麵包 4 大致肥陷阱</b></h3>\n<p>麵包係唔少香港人早餐或下午茶的「快靚正」之選，但原來看似平凡的菠蘿包、牛角酥、雞尾包，隨時暗藏致肥危機！以下拆解麵包 4 大致肥陷阱，下次揀麵包前記得諗清楚：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>血醣快速飆升：精緻麵包屬於高升醣指數（GI）食物，朝早空腹食會令血醣迅速上升，刺激分泌，好容易將脂肪鎖死喺體內</li>\n<li>容易越食越餓：血醣急劇上升之後會快速下降 , 餐後身體負擔劇烈波動，搞到個人好快又肚餓想食嘢，無形中增加全日嘅熱量攝取。</li>\n<li>隱形高脂高鈉危機：消委會指出，部分牛角酥、菠蘿包或雞尾包嘅脂肪同鈉含量極高，單食一個可能已經佔咗全日脂肪上限嘅幾成！。</li>\n<li>營養不均衡：淨係食麵包其實缺乏足夠嘅蛋白質同纖維，對維持肌肉同新陳代謝都非常不利，所以揀菠蘿包、牛角酥或者有餡麵包時，真係要諗過先好食！</li>\n</ol>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/istock-2246626897_2853718706ae41f943261e-1024x768.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"日本認證殺脂神物 （圖片來源：iStock）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"414\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/istock-2246626897_2853718706ae41f943261e-1024x768.jpg\" width=\"552\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：iStock）</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><b>無須捱餓戒口 都可以食住瘦？</b></h3>\n<p>對於「麵包控」或者懶得花時間準備早餐嘅人，與其辛苦戒麵包、斷食捱餓，不如搵個「食咩都得」嘅懶人方法！日本百年企業森下仁丹聯同京都大學醫學部共同研究嘅「2 回殺脂」，絕對係一大神器，品牌旗下產品全部由國際cGMP藥廠規格製成，並通過SGS檢查，確保安全可靠！</p>\n<h3><b>天然專利草本成分 真正止肥兼減肥</b></h3>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/fat-cancel-1-2_6215773096ae1bf8855279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"日本認證殺脂神物 （圖片來源：3ChemBio）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"485\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/fat-cancel-1-2_6215773096ae1bf8855279.jpg\" width=\"485\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：3ChemBio）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>「2回殺脂」主打天然草本、日本專利成分，無藥性、無副作用。療程分為餐前同餐後兩步曲，真正阻隔碳水化合物、熱量吸收，幫你輕鬆止肥、消脂！</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>「飯前の願望」（飯前服用）：</b> 內含專利天然草本成分Salacia MJ、迷迭香及烏龍茶精華，能有效阻隔及減少 50% 嘅碳水化合物與熱量吸收，阻止脂肪凝聚，真正做到有效「止肥」。</li>\n</ul>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-4_13368811156ae3119a6e8bf-1024x567.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"日本認證殺脂神物 （圖片來源：3ChemBio）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"221\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-4_13368811156ae3119a6e8bf-1024x567.png\" width=\"399\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：3ChemBio）</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><b>「飯後の減肥」（餐後服用）：</b> 含有獲得日本消費者廳認證嘅專利天然草本活性成分Tiliroside MJ，加上左旋肉鹼及芒果薑提取精華，有效提升代謝效率，激發身體消脂本能，有助降低內臟及皮下脂肪率，同時排走多餘水份去浮腫。</li>\n</ul>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-5_15290835666ae3119460abe-1024x511.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"日本認證殺脂神物 （圖片來源：3ChemBio）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"204\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-5_15290835666ae3119460abe-1024x511.png\" width=\"409\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：3ChemBio）</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><b>真實用家實證分享 有助回復輕盈體態</b></h3>\n<p>現時，用家實測證，使用「2回殺脂」3個月，成功減掉7公斤！高達 95% 用家都認同這款產品能有效阻隔 50% 脂肪及熱量吸收，82%用家表示產品有助自我消脂。唔洗戒口都可以維持好身段！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-6_6949499746ae314cad9ff1.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"369\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-6_6949499746ae314cad9ff1.png\" width=\"332\"/></a></p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/82-2_3507621896ae314f6f1d07.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"575\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/82-2_3507621896ae314f6f1d07-1024x613.png\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-1_1728630116ae314fb8b3d0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"526\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-1_1728630116ae314fb8b3d0-1024x561.png\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：3ChemBio）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>人氣用家<b>吳文懿 Kate</b> 自述，入行後為了保持專業的藝人體態，需要努力減肥，但又怕減肥藥有副作用，試完「森下仁丹 2回殺脂」之後明顯見到手臂、腰圍及下半身都明顯瘦咗，連塊面都尖咗，成分天然仲要冇副作用，依家每日都Keep住服用，希望可以保持身型！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-2026-10-29-5.38.01_8508350236ae314839d32f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"531\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-2026-10-29-5.38.01_8508350236ae314839d32f-1024x566.png\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：東張西望｜草本成份 二回殺脂）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-2026-10-29-5.39.53_11689686736ae314884dd49.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"613\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-2026-10-29-5.39.53_11689686736ae314884dd49-1024x654.png\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：東張西望｜草本成份 二回殺脂）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Nam（@bluenamchu）亦都表示因為要成日上鏡顧及身材，但又好鐘意食嘢，特別係戒唔到宵夜，搞到好困擾！但自從食咗「2 回殺脂」後，消化好咗，每日都去廁所去得好順暢，亦唔再需要節食同運動，身體都可以自動燃脂，仲要唔反彈！keep住食，手臂、腰都瘦左，線條firm哂！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/img_2043-2_19534293656ae1bf894e424.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：Instagram@bluenamchu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1662\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/img_2043-2_19534293656ae1bf894e424-1024x1773.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Instagram@bluenamchu）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/img_2046-2_3162058026ae3182b0ca38.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：Instagram@bluenamchu）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1658\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/img_2046-2_3162058026ae3182b0ca38-1024x1769.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：Instagram@bluenamchu）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<p>建議大家可以根據自己嘅BMI決定療程：BMI低於25可選「4級療程」，25或以上就可以揀「6級療程」，持續3個月效果最理想！</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-8_882776476ae31899adf5c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"461\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-8_882776476ae31899adf5c-1024x492.png\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：3ChemBio）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-7_17748809796ae3189ed0b46.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"421\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/-7_17748809796ae3189ed0b46-1024x449.png\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：3ChemBio）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h3><b>全年最抵 </b><b>限時買 3 送 1 優惠</b></h3>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/fat-cancel-1-2_7069886426ae318f749334.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"日本認證殺脂神物 （圖片來源：3ChemBio）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"378\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/fat-cancel-1-2_7069886426ae318f749334.jpg\" width=\"378\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：3ChemBio）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>想輕鬆食住瘦？由10月30日至11月19日期間，森下仁丹「2回殺脂」將會推出全年最抵限時優惠！每盒只需$496（原價$688），仲有買3送1優惠，平均每盒折實只係$372，萬寧有售！即刻趁優惠入手，體驗阻隔與消脂嘅雙重威力啦！</p>\n<p>立即入手︰ <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3TT0fC9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3TT0fC9</a><br/>\n了解更多︰<a href=\"https://www.jintan.com.hk/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.jintan.com.hk/</a></p>\n<p>（Presented by Jintan Fat Cancel）\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:26:53.846250+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1787,"images":15,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:00:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:43.545809+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:43.545809+00:00","content_hash":"0f0798aaff26719cb3792f8bbd46181581d097b45c482ac6c0a959707a998fac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}